#: ../../source/api/index.rst:2
msgid "API Reference"
msgstr "API 参考"

#: ../../source/api/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"The C API reference below is generated from the public C23 headers in the"
" sibling repositories by `Hawkmoth <https://hawkmoth.readthedocs.io/>`__."
" Declaration comments specify ownership, ``NULL`` handling, borrowing "
"lifetimes, threading rules, and error behavior."
msgstr ""
"以下 C API 参考由 `Hawkmoth <https://hawkmoth.readthedocs.io/>`__ 直接从同级源码仓库的公开 C23 "
"头文件生成。声明注释标明了所有权、 ``NULL`` 处理、借用生命周期、线程规则与错误行为。"

#: ../../source/api/index.rst:9
msgid ""
":doc:`core` — Headless layout, node tree, intrinsic/text measurement, and"
" display lists (``<xent/xent.h>``), used when building custom hosts or "
"headless layout pipelines."
msgstr ""
":doc:`core` —— 无头布局、节点树、固有尺寸/文本测量与显示列表（ ``<xent/xent.h>`` ），用于开发自定义宿主或无头排版管线。"

#: ../../source/api/index.rst:12
msgid ""
":doc:`kit` — Atomic ``XtkBatch`` protocol, retained ``XtkHost`` ABI, "
"event payloads, and reconciler runtime (``<xtk/...>``). Declarative "
"element builders are declared in ``<xtk/xtk.h>``; generated imperative "
"control wrappers are declared in ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>``."
msgstr ""
":doc:`kit` —— 原子化 ``XtkBatch`` 协议、保留式 ``XtkHost`` ABI、事件载荷与协调器运行时（ ``<xtk/...>`` ）。"
"声明式元素构建器声明于 ``<xtk/xtk.h>`` ，自动生成的命令式控件包装函数声明于 ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` 。"

#: ../../source/api/index.rst:16
msgid ""
":doc:`fluxent` — Native Windows application entry points (``flux_run``, "
"``FluxApp``), ``XtkHost`` attachment, windowing, menus, popups, file "
"dialogs, clipboard, and drag-and-drop (``<fluxent/...>``)."
msgstr ""
":doc:`fluxent` —— Windows 原生应用入口（ ``flux_run`` 、 ``FluxApp`` ）、 ``XtkHost`` 挂载、"
"窗口管理、菜单、弹出层、文件对话框、剪贴板与拖放接口（ ``<fluxent/...>`` ）。"
